格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Rule-first pre-step skill router for DeepSeek Harness — pours matched skills on high-confidence hits, stays silent otherwise. Deterministic: zero LLM calls, zero token cost until a rule pours, one pour per session, broken YAML never breaks the session. 规则路由 · 高置信命中 · 静默放行 · 零 Tok","id":"gh:1336061050","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skill-router","slug":"MJorgin/dsh-skill-router","topics":["agent-skills","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","skill-router"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Rule-first pre-step skill router for DeepSeek Harness — pours matched skills on high-confidence hits"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", stays silent otherwise. Deterministic: zero LLM calls, zero token cost until a rule pours, one pou"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"r per session, broken YAML never breaks the session. 规则路由 · 高置信命中 · 静默放行 · 零 Tok"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🍸→⚙️ dsh-skill-router"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"### *Rule-first pre-step skill routing for DeepSeek Harness: pours matched skills, stays silent when"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"-first pre-step skill routing for DeepSeek Harness: pours matched skills, stays silent when unsure.*"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Companion executor to skill-bartender:\nthe skill carries the policy *judgment*, this plugin carries "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"the *execution*.\nDeterministic, **zero LLM calls, zero token cost** until a rule actually pours:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- ⚡ **Pre-step hook** — reads the latest user message before every step.\n- 🧭 **Rule-first matching**"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" — user-editable YAML policy (`~/.dsh/skill-router.yaml`,\nbundled defaults in `default-policy.yaml`)"},{"id":"p5s3","text":", first match wins.\n- 🔇 **Silent miss** — no hit → zero intervention; the model keeps its normal\ncat"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"alog flow.\n- ♻️ **Once per session** — each skill pours at most once.\n- 🛡️ **Broken YAML never break"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"s the session** — falls back to bundled defaults."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Why · How it works · What you get · Quick start · See it in action · Policy · Tested · Scope & non-g"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"oals · FAQ · Layout · License"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**English** · **简体中文**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🤔 Why"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Most skill loading is left to the model's judgment: it sees the catalog every\nstep, re-decides every"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" time, and often loads late, wrong, or not at all. A\nrouter that runs *before* the model answers fix"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"nd often loads late, wrong, or not at all. A\nrouter that runs *before* the model answers fixes that:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| | dsh-skill-router | LLM-judge router | Manual loading |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Decision maker | **rules** (deterministic) | LLM / embeddings | the model, per step |\n| Token cost"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" | zero until a rule pours | every step | every step |\n| Latency added | ~0 ms | model round-trip | "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"n/a |\n| Reproducible | ✅ same message → same pour | ❌ varies | ❌ varies |\n| User control | edit YAML"},{"id":"p11s4","text":", done | prompt it | hope it remembers |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Why rules and not an LLM judge?** Speed, cost, and predictability. A\nURL-path rule routes `feishu."},{"id":"p12s2","text":"cn/x/docx/` to `lark-doc` in microseconds, for\nfree, every time — and `skill-bartender`'s routing ta"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ble is where the policy\n*judgment* lives. This plugin is the muscle, not the brain."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## ⚙️ How it works"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Hooks `agent/pre-step`, reads the latest user message.\n- Matches it against user-editable rules (`"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"~/.dsh/skill-router.yaml`, bundled\ndefaults in `default-policy.yaml`). First match wins.\n- On a hit:"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" pours the matched skill bodies into the step as\n`skill-invocation` messages — the catalog's \"alread"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"y loaded, don't\nre-load\" rule applies automatically.\n- No hit: zero intervention. The model keeps it"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"s normal catalog flow.\n- Each skill pours at most once per session."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## ✨ What you get"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Capability | What it does |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| ⚡ Pre-step hook | `agent/pre-step` — the pour happens *before* the model starts thinking |\n| 🧭 YAM"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"L policy | User-editable `~/.dsh/skill-router.yaml`; broken YAML falls back to bundled defaults |\n| "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"🔎 `whenToUse` triggers | Installed skills' `whenToUse` frontmatter acts as a secondary trigger (lite"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ral phrase match, appended after YAML rules) |\n| 🚀 Zero cost | No LLM judge, no embeddings — rules o"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"nly (fast, free, deterministic) |\n| ♻️ Once per session | Dedupes pours per session; no skill body f"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"loods the context |\n| 🔗 Companion | Works with skill-bartender's routing table and taste test |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## ⚡ Quick start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Then restart the running instance (profile bundles load at boot)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Verify: say \"生成一张海报\" — `media-tools` pours automatically; say \"这个截图帮我检查一下\" — `vision-review` pours. "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"No rules matched? The model just works as usual."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 📸 See it in action"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"*One picture: a rule hits → the skill pours before the model answers; no hit → total silence.*"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🧭 Policy"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Ordered by precision: URL-path routing first, media, delegation, workflow\nskills before atomics.\n-"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" First matching rule wins; `pour` lists the skill names to load.\n- Broken YAML falls back to bundled"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" defaults and never breaks the session.\n- Write it as data: improve matching by editing YAML, not co"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"de.\n- Full reference: docs/POLICY.md · bundled defaults: default-policy.yaml · walkthrough: docs/EXA"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"l reference: docs/POLICY.md · bundled defaults: default-policy.yaml · walkthrough: docs/EXAMPLES.md."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🧪 Tested"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Integration suite (10 cases) run against a live profile: pour, dedupe,\nzero-touch, reject passthroug"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"h, URL routing, mail-vs-IM disambiguation,\nfalse-positive guards. See `test/` in the repo, plus the "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"design notes in\nDESIGN.md and the gold-task list in GOLD-TASKS.md."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🎯 Scope & non-goals"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- No LLM judge, no embeddings: rules only (fast, free, deterministic).\n- No auto-install of missing "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"skills: that stays in skill-bartender's\nquarantine → SkillSpector → human-approval flow.\n- Rule tabl"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"e is data: improve matching by editing YAML, not code.\n- `whenToUse` frontmatter on installed skills"},{"id":"p30s4","text":" acts as a secondary trigger\n(literal phrase match, appended after YAML rules). Write it as a short\n"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"trigger phrase; long prose never matches. Today's skill data mostly lacks\nthe field — skill-bartende"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"r's taste test can backfill it."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## ❓ FAQ"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Does it consume tokens when nothing matches?**\nNo. No hit → zero intervention, zero LLM calls. The"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" router only reads text\nalready in the step and runs regex rules — microseconds, free."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**How is it different from skill-bartender?**\nskill-bartender is the *judgment* (which skill fits, w"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"hen to stay silent, how\nto install safely). This plugin is the *execution* (a deterministic pre-step"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"\nhook that pours). They complement each other; the router works standalone too."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Can I use my own rules?**\nYes — copy `default-policy.yaml` to `~/.dsh/skill-router.yaml` and edit."},{"id":"p34s2","text":"\nFirst match wins; broken YAML falls back to defaults."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Does it pour the same skill twice in one session?**\nNo — each skill pours at most once per session"},{"id":"p35s2","text":", so context never floods."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## 🗺️ Layout"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
